    - target: {fileID: 1963447426254693402, guid: 67e37d9bfe6cf0843959ec09856e65b9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "In 1836, Santa Anna\u2019s army reached San Antonio. Around 180 Texans,
        including famous figures like Davy Crockett and James Bowie, defended the
        Alamo mission. Santa Anna flew a black flag\u2014meaning no mercy. The Texans
        refused to surrender. T"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
